# Laptop Agent Configuration

## Backend Server
BACKEND_URL=ws://localhost:8000
API_TOKEN=your-api-token-from-device-registration

## Device
DEVICE_ID=laptop-001
DEVICE_NAME=My Laptop

## Metrics
METRICS_INTERVAL=30

## Logging
LOG_LEVEL=INFO

## Features
ENABLE_SCREENSHOT=true
ENABLE_SCRIPTS=true
SCRIPT_TIMEOUT=300
